OL,3,ABluetongue virus confirmed on County
OL,4,ADown farm
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe first case of Bluetongue in
OL,7,FNorthern Ireland this season has been
OL,8,Fconfirmed on a farm in Kilkeel, County
OL,9,FDown.
OL,11,FOfficials from the Department of
OL,12,FAgriculture, Environment and Rural
OL,13,FAffairs (Daera) said the virus had been
OL,14,Fdetected in three sheep.
OL,16,FThere will be no additional movement
OL,17,Frestrictions or disease control zones,
OL,18,Fbecause the virus has been present in
OL,19,FNorthern Ireland since November 2025.
OL,21,FIt presents no risk to public health.
OL,23,APub: 14-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
